{"id":"de14d8d6c42250de","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-characteristic.md","title":"特征函数","display":"df-characteristic — 特征函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-characteristic","aliases":["20-df-characteristic"],"display":"df-characteristic — 特征函数","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[257],"source_printed_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-characteristic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-characteristic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-characteristic — 特征函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>257</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\chi_A(\\vec x):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\vec x\\in A,\\\\0&amp;\\vec x\\notin A.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\chi_A(\\vec x):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\vec x\\in A,\\\\0&amp;\\vec x\\notin A.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{set}(X):=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\nA\\upharpoonright n:=\\chi_A\\upharpoonright n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega),\\qquad\n\\sigma\\preceq A\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ A\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{set}(X):=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\nA\\upharpoonright n:=\\chi_A\\upharpoonright n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega),\\qquad\n\\sigma\\preceq A\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ A\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega,\\ \\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega,\\ \\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>集合与其特征函数可以互换，但集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 与串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的类型不同。以函数作 oracle 时可使用其图的配对编码。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.2；印刷页 230；PDF 第 257 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\chi_A(\\vec x):=\\begin{cases}1&\\vec x\\in A,\\\\0&\\vec x\\notin A.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{set}(X):=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\nA\\upharpoonright n:=\\chi_A\\upharpoonright n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega),\\qquad\n\\sigma\\preceq A\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega},\\ A\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega,\\ \\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1428,"backlinks":[{"id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"re